{"text":"For a long time, my love for books was more cloistered, less zealot, but in 2011, all of that changed. The two major bookstores in Nashville closed, and after waiting around for someone else to open a bookstore, I decided to do it myself. This was not the fulfillment of a lifelong dream. It was more like irritation. People love to tell me that bookstores are dead, that books themselves are hobbling towards the dust heap of cultural irrelevance. Heresy, I say. Books are the rock on which I built my church. Like the Hare Krishna, I didn't do this because of what I needed. I had books. I would always have books. I fought for books because you need them.","words":[{"text":"For","start":0.0,"end":1.14},{"text":"a","start":1.14,"end":1.28},{"text":"long","start":1.28,"end":1.5},{"text":"time","start":1.5,"end":1.98,"punct":","},{"text":"my","start":2.04,"end":2.22},{"text":"love","start":2.22,"end":2.46},{"text":"for","start":2.46,"end":2.7},{"text":"books","start":2.7,"end":3.04},{"text":"was","start":3.04,"end":3.4},{"text":"more","start":3.4,"end":3.84},{"text":"cloistered","start":3.84,"end":4.52,"punct":","},{"text":"less","start":4.86,"end":5.04},{"text":"zealot","start":5.04,"end":6.06,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":6.1,"end":6.32},{"text":"in","start":6.32,"end":6.6},{"text":"2011","start":6.6,"end":7.28,"punct":","},{"text":"all","start":7.54,"end":7.8},{"text":"of","start":7.8,"end":7.96},{"text":"that","start":7.96,"end":8.18},{"text":"changed","start":8.18,"end":8.68,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":9.48,"end":9.56},{"text":"two","start":9.56,"end":9.76},{"text":"major","start":9.76,"end":10.06},{"text":"bookstores","start":10.06,"end":10.62},{"text":"in","start":10.62,"end":10.94},{"text":"Nashville","start":10.94,"end":11.44},{"text":"closed","start":11.44,"end":12.12,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":12.52,"end":12.72},{"text":"after","start":12.72,"end":13.14},{"text":"waiting","start":13.14,"end":13.5},{"text":"around","start":13.5,"end":1